# StatLab Experiments — Environment variables

## Frontend (`frontend/`)

Copy this file to `frontend/.env.local` for local overrides (optional).

```bash
# Backend base URL used by next.config.ts rewrites.
# Local default (if unset): http://127.0.0.1:5000
API_BACKEND_URL=http://127.0.0.1:5000
```

### Production (Vercel — project `statlab-experiments`)

| Name | Example | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `API_BACKEND_URL` | `https://statlab-experiments-api.vercel.app` | Public URL of the Flask project. Not a secret. |

Set with:

```bash
cd frontend
vercel env add API_BACKEND_URL production --value https://statlab-experiments-api.vercel.app --no-sensitive --yes
```

## Backend (`api-server/`)

No environment variables required for the current MVP (stateless API).
